--[[
    Grok UI Library
    A modern, client-side Roblox UI library for Luau.
    
    Features:
    - Fully draggable windows
    - Title + Subtitle header
    - Horizontal tabs along the top
    - Smooth gradients & modern dark themes
    - Proper padding / offsets (no overlapping elements)
    - Responsive layouts using UIListLayout + UIPadding
    
    Elements:
    - Tabs
    - Sections
    - Toggles
    - Buttons
    - Single Dropdowns
    - Multi Dropdowns
    - Keybind Selectors
    - Labels
    - Color Pickers
    - Sliders (bonus)
    - Textboxes (bonus)
    - Paragraphs (bonus)
    - Dividers (bonus)
    - Notifications (bonus)
]]

